{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12050","headline":"送陆协律赴端州 · 贾至","name":"送陆协律赴端州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越井人南去，湘川水北流。\n江边数杯酒，海内一孤舟。\n岭峤同仙客，京华即旧游。\n春心将别恨，万里共悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《诗人玉屑》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩人玉屑_(四庫全書本)）"}